I fixed every claim the verifier flagged in the campaign state file. I launched nothing new: both training slots are in use. Nothing needed from you.

**What the verifier caught, now corrected**
- **Wrong comparison:** the compressor-frozen run at seed 43 was described as sitting between the fully frozen run and the reference on held-out loss (loss on 64 held-out rows). It does only at 0.23 epoch. At 0.46 and 0.69 epoch it is above both (0.449 against 0.439 for the reference and 0.431 for frozen, at 0.46).
- **Row count, flagged twice:** one epoch is 27,936 training rows over 437 steps, not 28,032. I checked it in five training logs and fixed it everywhere. The ledger got a correcting note, because old entries can't be edited.
- **Wrong citation:** one connector-frozen check was listed as proof that a trainable connector gain never moves in this recipe. In that run the gain is frozen, so the check proves nothing about that. I removed it from the list.
- I also noted a second difference besides the weights: the frozen side runs in eval mode, with no LoRA dropout (LoRA = the small trainable adapters).

**Running now**
| Run | Progress | Expected end |
|---|---|---|
| Compressor frozen, seed 43 | 90% of one epoch | about 16:40 today (time limit 17:49) |
| Connector frozen, seed 42 | 3% of one epoch, training loss in line with the reference at the same point | about 02:10 tomorrow |

- The seed-43 run has slowed in the last few steps, from about 87 to about 100 seconds per step. Nothing points to a fault, and it still ends well before its time limit.
- The eval and model code checksums are unchanged, so the earlier reference scores still pair with the new runs.

**Next**
The campaign wakes when one of these happens first (or after 4 hours at most):
- The seed-43 run finishes. It then launches the connector-frozen seed-43 run, chained to its evals and its check that the frozen parts did not move.
- The connector-frozen seed-42 run writes its step-100 checkpoint (about 17:40). It then starts an early scored check on 300 document questions.

The compressor-frozen seed-42 evals are still queued on the shared preemptible partition. The scheduler estimates 16 November.
